OL,3,GNEWSATrains cancelled on Fen Line after
OL,4,Awires damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FDamage to overhead wires has caused the
OL,7,Fcancellation of all trains on the Fen
OL,8,FLine, between Cambridge and King's Lynn
OL,9,Fin Norfolk.
OL,11,FTrain operator Great Northern said the
OL,12,Fdamage had happened between Ely in
OL,13,FCambridgeshire, and the west Norfolk
OL,14,Ftown on Monday.
OL,16,FLondon King's Cross-King's Lynn
OL,17,Fservices have been cancelled, while the
OL,18,Fnumber of King's Cross-Ely trains has
OL,19,Fbeen reduced, a spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
